{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blossom\u2019s Grove is a relaxing farming &amp; life sim where English grows with you \u2014 no flashcards, no tests.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHAT YOU\u2019LL DO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Gather &amp; Farm</strong><br>Forage in the wild, mine ores, fish, and clear land to collect resources.<br>Plant seeds, water crops, and harvest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Build Your Grove</strong><br>Collect blueprints from villagers and quests. Craft furniture, tools, and facilities, then place them anywhere on your land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Shop &amp; Supply</strong><br>Visit the general store, food truck, and ice cream cart to buy seeds, ingredients, and decorations. Sell your harvest to fund your expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Befriend the Town</strong><br>Talk with villagers daily. Each conversation displays <strong>English dialogue + your subtitle language</strong> (ZH/ES/FR/JR/KR/RU/PT/DE).<br>They\u2019ll give you requests \u2014 complete them to earn rewards and unlock story events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Learn Without Trying</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick up or use any item \u2192 hear its English word spoken aloud</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All encountered words are auto-saved to your in-game Word Book</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open the Word Book anytime to review pronunciation and meaning</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pressure. Just plant, build, chat, and let the words sink in.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3673180?t=1771939065","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673180/6f4e1971b25b9c22a2d879f978415be0be1df8cb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771939065","capsu